{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  DTC SHOP BY CATEGORY SECTION - CATEGORY NAVIGATION GRID
  =============================================================================
  Category navigation section with responsive grid layout and custom styling
  - Inline CSS for section-specific styling and responsive design
  - 4-column desktop grid that collapses to 2-column mobile grid
  - Custom background colors and styling options
  - Category cards with images, titles, and descriptions
  - Responsive typography and spacing adjustments
  - Used for DTC Pages CRO group's category navigation testing
  - Part of the experimental category organization system
{% endcomment %}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  INLINE CSS STYLING FOR SHOP BY CATEGORY
  =============================================================================
  Section-specific CSS with responsive design and custom styling
  - #shopify-section-{{ section.id }}: Section-specific targeting
  - .shop-by-category: Main container styling
  - Responsive grid layout with mobile breakpoints
  - Custom background colors and spacing controls
{% endcomment %}
<style>
{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  MAIN SECTION CONTAINER STYLING
  =============================================================================
  Primary container styling with background and spacing
  - overflow-x: hidden: Prevents horizontal scrolling
  - padding: 50px 0: Vertical spacing above and below
  - background-color: Dynamic background from theme editor
  - section.settings.section_background: Custom background color
{% endcomment %}
#shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .shop-by-category {
  overflow-x:hidden;
  padding: 50px 0;
  background-color:{{ section.settings.section_background }};
}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  ALTERNATIVE LAYOUT STYLING
  =============================================================================
  Alternative layout option with different styling
  - shop-by-category-alt: Alternative layout class
  - display: none: Hidden by default
  - padding-top: 12px: Additional top spacing for H2 elements
{% endcomment %}
.shop-by-category-alt{
  display:none;
}
.shop-by-category-alt .shop-by-category-content h2{
 padding-top:12px;
}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  TITLE WRAPPER LAYOUT
  =============================================================================
  Container for section title and link with flexbox layout
  - shop-by-title-wrapper: Title and link container
  - display: flex: Enables flexible layout
  - align-items: center: Vertically centers elements
  - justify-content: space-between: Spreads title and link apart
{% endcomment %}
.shop-by-title-wrapper{
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:space-between;
}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  SECTION TITLE STYLING
  =============================================================================
  Main section heading with custom typography
  - text-align: left: Left-aligned text
  - font-size: 40px: Large desktop font size
  - Responsive sizing handled in media queries
{% endcomment %}
.shop-by-title-wrapper h2{
  text-align:left;
  font-size:40px;
}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  SHOP BY LINK BUTTON STYLING
  =============================================================================
  Call-to-action button for category navigation
  - border: 2px solid #36409A: Custom border color
  - color: #36409A: Text color matching border
  - border-radius: 32px: Rounded button corners
  - padding: 8px 24px: Button spacing
  - font-size: 20px: Button text size
  - font-weight: 600: Semi-bold text weight
{% endcomment %}
.shop-by-link{
  border:2px solid #36409A;
  color:#36409A;
  border-radius: 32px;
  padding: 8px 24px;
  font-size:20px;
  font-weight:600;
}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  CATEGORY ITEMS GRID LAYOUT
  =============================================================================
  CSS Grid container for category navigation items
  - display: grid: CSS Grid layout system
  - grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr): 4 equal columns
  - grid-gap: 20px: Spacing between grid items
  - margin-top: 32px: Top spacing from title section
{% endcomment %}
.shop-by-category-items{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  grid-gap: 20px;
  margin-top:32px;
}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  INDIVIDUAL CATEGORY ITEM STYLING
  =============================================================================
  Styling for individual category navigation cards
  - text-align: left: Left-aligned content
  - background: #ECEBFF: Light purple background color
  - border-radius: 24px: Rounded card corners
{% endcomment %}
.shop-by-category-items div{
  text-align:left;
  background:#ECEBFF;
  border-radius:24px;
}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  CATEGORY ITEM IMAGE STYLING
  =============================================================================
  Styling for category item images
  - border-radius: 24px 24px 0 0: Rounded top corners only
  - width: 100%: Full width within container
  - Maintains aspect ratio and responsive sizing
{% endcomment %}
.shop-by-category-items div img{
  border-radius:24px 24px 0 0;
  width:100%;
}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  CATEGORY CONTENT CONTAINER
  =============================================================================
  Container for category text content
  - text-align: left: Left-aligned text
  - padding: 16px: Content spacing
  - display: flex: Flexible layout for content
  - flex-direction: column: Vertical content stacking
  - gap: 12px: Spacing between content elements
{% endcomment %}
.shop-by-category-content{
  text-align:left;
  padding:16px;
  display:flex;
  flex-direction:column;
  gap:12px;
}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  CATEGORY CONTENT HEADING
  =============================================================================
  Styling for category item headings
  - text-align: left: Left-aligned text
  - margin: 0: No external margins
  - font-size: 24px: Category title size
{% endcomment %}
.shop-by-category-content h2{
  text-align:left;
  margin:0;
  font-size:24px;
}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  CATEGORY CONTENT DESCRIPTION
  =============================================================================
  Styling for category item descriptions
  - text-align: left: Left-aligned text
  - margin: 0: No external margins
  - font-size: 16px: Description text size
{% endcomment %}
.shop-by-category-content p{
  text-align:left;
  margin:0;
  font-size:16px;
}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  MOBILE RESPONSIVE DESIGN
  =============================================================================
  Mobile-specific styling for screens 768px and below
  - @media screen and (max-width: 768px): Mobile breakpoint
  - Grid changes from 4 columns to 2 columns
  - Typography scales down for mobile devices
  - Button sizing adjusts for mobile interaction
{% endcomment %}
@media screen and (max-width: 768px) {
  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    MOBILE TITLE STYLING
    =============================================================================
    Mobile title adjustments for smaller screens
    - text-align: left: Maintains left alignment
    - font-size: 24px: Reduced from 40px for mobile
  {% endcomment %}
  .shop-by-title-wrapper h2{
    text-align:left;
    font-size:24px;
  }

  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    MOBILE GRID LAYOUT
    =============================================================================
    Mobile grid changes from 4 to 2 columns
    - grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr): 2 equal columns
    - Maintains responsive design on small screens
  {% endcomment %}
  .shop-by-category-items{
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  }

  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    MOBILE CONTENT SPACING
    =============================================================================
    Reduced spacing for mobile content
    - padding: 12px: Reduced from 16px
    - gap: 4px: Reduced from 12px
    - Optimizes mobile screen real estate
  {% endcomment %}
  .shop-by-category-content{
    padding:12px;
    gap:4px;
  }

  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    MOBILE BUTTON STYLING
    =============================================================================
    Mobile button adjustments for touch interaction
    - padding: 8px 20px: Reduced horizontal padding
    - font-size: 14px: Smaller text for mobile
    - width: 100%: Full width within container
    - max-width: 112px: Maximum button width
    - border: 1px solid: Thinner border for mobile
    - font-weight: 500: Reduced weight for mobile
    - text-align: center: Centers text in button
  {% endcomment %}
  .shop-by-link{
    padding: 8px 20px;
    font-size:14px;
    width:100%;
    max-width:112px;
    border:1px solid #36409A;
    font-weight:500;
    text-align:center;
  }

  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    MOBILE CONTENT TYPOGRAPHY
    =============================================================================
    Mobile typography scaling for readability
    - font-size: 16px: Reduced from 24px for headings
    - font-size: 14px: Reduced from 16px for descriptions
    - line-height: 19.04px: Optimized line height for mobile
  {% endcomment %}
  .shop-by-category-content h2{
    font-size:16px;
  }
  .shop-by-category-content p{
    font-size:14px;
    line-height:19.04px;
  }
}
</style>

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  MAIN SECTION CONTAINER
  =============================================================================
  Primary container for shop by category section
  - shop-by-category: Main section styling class
  - section.settings.section_custom_class: Additional custom CSS class
  - wide-container: Full-width container for content
{% endcomment %}
<div class="shop-by-category {{ section.settings.section_custom_class }}">
  <div class="wide-container">
    <div class="shop-by-title-wrapper">
      <h2 class="shop-by-title">{{ section.settings.section_title }}</h2>
      <a href="/collections/all-products" class="shop-by-link">Shop All</a>
    </div>
    <div class="shop-by-category-items">
    {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
      <div>
        <a href="{{ block.settings.category_link }}">
          {%- case block.type -%}
            {%- when 'category' -%}
              {{ block.settings.category_image | image_url: width: category_image.width | image_tag: class: '', loading: 'lazy' }}
              <div class="shop-by-category-content">
                <h2>{{ block.settings.category_title }}</h2>
                <p>{{ block.settings.category_description }}</p>
              </div>
          {%- endcase -%}
        </a>
      </div>
    {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Dtc shop by category",
  "class": "shop-by-category-section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "section_custom_class",
      "label": "Section custom class",
      "placeholder": "Custom class"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "section_title",
      "label": "Section Title",
      "default": "Categories",
      "placeholder": "Section Title"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "section_background",
      "label": "Section background",
      "default": "#F3F4F9"
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "name": "Category",
      "type": "category",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "image_picker",
          "id": "category_image",
          "label": "Category Image"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "category_title",
          "label": "Category Title"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "category_description",
          "label": "Category Description"
        },
        {
          "type": "url",
          "id": "category_link",
          "label": "Category Link"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "dtc Shop By Category"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}